?><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Audience report · Local CrimeWatch</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="admin.css?v=2"><link rel="stylesheet" href="sales-report.css?v=1"><script defer src="sales-report.js?v=1"></script></head><body><main class="sales-report"><div class="report-actions"><a href="admin.php">← Admin</a><button id="printReport">Print / save as PDF</button><a href="analytics-api.php?action=export&amp;days=<?=$days?>">Download CSV</a></div><p class="private-note">PRIVATE PREVIEW · Only signed-in admins can view this page. Share a saved copy when you choose.</p><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL CRIMEWATCH · ADVERTISER INFORMATION</p><h1>A local audience.<br>A place for your business.</h1><p class="report-period"><?=$e($s['from'])?> — <?=$e($s['to'])?> · Central Time</p><div class="stats"><div><strong><?=$n($totals['page_view']??0)?></strong><span>Measured page views</span></div><div><strong><?=$n($s['registered'])?></strong><span>Verified reader accounts · current total</span></div><div><strong><?=$n($s['newRegistered'])?></strong><span>New verified accounts in this period</span></div></div><section class="panel"><h2>Reach people reading local reports</h2><p>Local CrimeWatch brings community incident reports and daily arrest reports together. Advertising placements are available for attorneys, bail bond businesses, and other local services. Business profiles open on CrimeWatch.</p><p><strong>Peak daily visitor estimate:</strong> <?=$n($peak)?>.<br><strong>Paid ad views:</strong> <?=$n($totals['ad_impression']??0)?>.<br><strong>Business-profile opens:</strong> <?=$n($totals['ad_click']??0)?>.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Community readership</h2><?php if(!$communities): ?><p>Measurement has just started. Community totals will appear as visits arrive.</p><?php else: ?><table><thead><tr><th>Selected community</th><th>Page views</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($communities as $area=>$views): ?><tr><td><?=$e(cw_area_label($area))?></td><td><?=$n($views)?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table><?php endif; ?></section><section class="panel"><h2>Advertising opportunities</h2><p>Community banner · Daily Arrests placement · Optional bottom banner</p><p>Contact <strong>info@crimewatch.live</strong> for availability and pricing.</p></section><p class="muted">Measurement began <?=$e(substr($s['started'],0,10))?> (UTC). Earlier traffic is not included. Page views count browser visits once per selected community during a page visit. Daily visitor estimates use a daily-changing identifier and are not monthly unique people. Shared networks, changing connections, blockers, opt-outs and automated traffic affect accuracy. Ad views require at least half of the ad to be visible for one second. Views and profile opens are counted once per ad, placement, community and page visit. Profile opens are not calls, qualified leads or sales. No reader contact details are included.</p><p class="muted">Generated <?=$e(gmdate('Y-m-d H:i'))?> UTC · Local CrimeWatch</p></main></body></html>
